<!--
=====================================================================
 File: GalleryView.fxml          (Screen 4 of 7)
 Layer: VIEW (MVC) - Requirement R1
 Controller: com.artgallery.controller.GalleryController
=====================================================================

 PURPOSE
 Main screen. Displays all artworks as image cards and lets the user
 search, filter (All / Oil Paintings / Pastel Paintings) and sort.

 LAYOUT PANES TO USE (Lecture 6)
 - BorderPane as the root.
     top    : VBox containing
                - HBox: welcomeLabel + (spacer) + My Activity,
                  Statistics and Logout buttons
                - HBox: search TextField, the 3 RadioButtons,
                  and the sort ComboBox
     center : ScrollPane that contains a FlowPane (artworkFlowPane).
              The controller adds one card (VBox: ImageView + Label)
              per artwork into this FlowPane.
     bottom : resultCountLabel

 UI CONTROLS NEEDED (give each an fx:id)
 - Label        welcomeLabel       : "Welcome, ..."
 - TextField    searchField        : promptText "Search by title or artist"
 - RadioButton  allRadio           : "All"           (selected by default)
 - RadioButton  oilRadio           : "Oil Paintings"
 - RadioButton  pastelRadio        : "Pastel Paintings"
 - ToggleGroup  categoryGroup      : shared by the 3 RadioButtons
 - ComboBox     sortComboBox       : "Title A-Z", "Most Liked", "Highest Rated"
 - ScrollPane + FlowPane artworkFlowPane
 - Label        resultCountLabel   : "Showing X artworks"
 - Button       myActivityButton   : "My Activity"
 - Button       statisticsButton   : "Statistics"
 - Button       logoutButton       : "Logout"

 EXPECTED INTERACTIONS
 - Typing in the search field updates the gallery live (ChangeListener, R2).
 - Selecting a RadioButton filters by category.
 - Choosing a sort option re-orders the cards.
 - Clicking an artwork card opens ArtworkDetailsView.fxml (mouse event, R2).
 - Buttons open My Activity / Statistics, or log out to WelcomeView.

 CONTROLLER
 fx:controller="com.artgallery.controller.GalleryController"
=====================================================================
-->
